{"ref":"BDB, נֹ֫בַח","hw":"נֹ֫בַח","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֹ֫בַח</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. et loc. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> m.</strong> a Manassite <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:42\" href=\"/Numbers.32.42\">Nu 32:42</a> (JE), 𝔊 Ναβαν.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> loc.</strong> in Gilead <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:11\" href=\"/Judges.8.11\">Ju 8:11</a>, 𝔊 Ναβαι, Ναβε(θ); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:42\" href=\"/Numbers.32.42\">Nu 32:42</a> (formerly <span dir=\"rtl\">קְנָת</span>, q.v.), 𝔊 Ναβωθ.","next":"BDB, נִבְחַז","prev":"BDB, נָבַח"}